@ Start

- Melusina
  We have reached the high balcony of the cathedral. Look up at the sky...

- Sir Melodious
  Behold, Melusina. The ancient wonder of our world—the Sea Above.

* Gaze upward into the inverted celestial ocean. | -> WitnessSeaAbove
* Step to the edge of the overlook railing.     | -> ApproachEdge

<@> ApproachEdge

- Melusina
  The wind carries salt and starlight. The sky isn't air at all—it's an immense canopy of luminous water.

- Sir Melodious
  Watch the surface membrane. The biological pulse is beginning.

-> WitnessSeaAbove

<@> WitnessSeaAbove

- .
  Above the cathedral arches, an inverted ocean rolls in deep sapphire and turquoise waves. Every sixteen seconds, a deep bioluminescent pulse radiates across the celestial membrane.

- .
  Small droplets break from the surface and fall upward into the sky, sparkling like inverted rain against the bell-tower shadows.

$ Notify melodia:travel:/Game/EnvSandbox/Monoliths/SeaAbove/Prototype/LV_SeaAbove_Prototype
$ Notify melodia:stat:intent.sea_above.witness:melodia_resonance:5
$ Notify melodia:flag:flag.cutscene.sea_above_witnessed:true
$ Notify melodia:flag:flag.sea_above.membrane_pulse_active:true
$ Notify melodia:reward:reward.cutscene.sea_above_memory

- Melusina
  It is breathtaking. The entire ocean breathes in rhythm above us.

- Sir Melodious
  And now, with the Resonant Weave and our choral companion at your side, you are ready to explore where no melody-weaver has walked before.

$ Notify melodia:questcomplete:quest.cutscene.sea_above:flag.cutscene.sea_above_completed:reward.cutscene.sea_above_memory:intent.cutscene.sea_above.complete:checkpoint.cutscene.sea_above.complete

@ Finish

- .
  Melusina witnesses the magnificent spectacle of the Sea Above. The vertical slice journey reaches its breathtaking pinnacle.

$ End
